OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to cut parking fees not
OL,4,Aenough - councillors
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf councillors approve the planned
OL,7,Fchanges to Minster Badge discounts on
OL,8,FWednesday, permits would cost #15
OL,9,Fannually, rather than #45 for two
OL,10,Fyears. The Minster Badge gives
OL,11,Fresidents discounts on parking in
OL,12,Fcouncil car parks and on-street parking
OL,13,Fbays.
OL,15,FRuth Phillips, co-owner of Bishopthorpe
OL,16,FRoad's Good Food Shop, said the cuts
OL,17,Fwould not provide enough support to
OL,18,Fpeople struggling amid difficult
OL,19,Feconomic times.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
